        },
        {
          "text": "shrink the left while any count > k",
          "at": [
            800,
            548
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "IF ONLY a–z CAN APPEAR",
          "at": [
            1300,
            300
          ],
          "accent": true
        },
        {
          "text": "one 26-bit number is the whole set",
          "at": [
            1300,
            548
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "eyebrow": "Takeaway",
      "chapter": "Recap",
      "caption": "The big idea: a *sliding window* that grows on the right and jumps on the left. It fits almost any \"longest run where…\" question.",
      "dur": 8,
      "form": {
